<!-- [XPLAT] migrated from net48/WinForms — see MIGRATION_DOCS/TRANSITION_MAP.md -->
<!--
    [XPLAT] AgOpenGPS (GPS program) — "Quick AB / Tracks" track builder (Avalonia view).

    1:1 PARITY reimplementation of the WinForms `Forms/Guidance/FormQuickAB` (FormQuickAB.cs +
    FormQuickAB.Designer.cs). It is a small multi-step wizard for creating a guidance Track:
    a "choose" panel (A+ / AB-line / Curve) leads to the matching builder panel and finally a
    "name" panel. Per AAP §0.3.3 this is visual + behavioural FIDELITY to the currently rendered
    Windows Forms UI, never a redesign: no new colours, no relayout, no UX changes. Avalonia 11.3.

    WINDOW SHELL — mirrors FormQuickAB (Designer + FormQuickAB_Load):
      Text "Tracks"                    : design-time Title; the code-behind sets the localised
                                         runtime caption from gStr.gsQuickAB (parity with the ctor).
      Size 270 x 360 (set in Load,      : Width / Height. The designer's ClientSize (763 x 654) is a
        overriding the designer)          design-surface artefact; FormQuickAB_Load resizes the form
                                          to 270 x 360 at runtime, so that is the real window size.
      BackColor WhiteSmoke              : Background="WhiteSmoke".
      FormBorderStyle.FixedSingle       : CanResize="False". [XPLAT] ControlBox=false / MaximizeBox=
        + ControlBox/Max/Min = false      false / MinimizeBox=false hide the native title-bar buttons
                                          on WinForms; that is not portable, so SystemDecorations="Full"
                                          keeps a standard (non-resizable) frame — minor chrome variance
                                          is acceptable for a fixed dialog.
      ShowInTaskbar = false             : ShowInTaskbar="False".
      StartPosition CenterParent +      : WindowStartupLocation="Manual" — FormQuickAB_Load restores
        Location = setWindow_QuickAB-      Properties.Settings.Default.setWindow_QuickABLocation; the
        Location                           code-behind reproduces that in the Opened handler and falls
                                           back to CenterOwner when the saved point is off-screen
                                           (ScreenHelper.IsOnScreen parity).
      Font Tahoma                       : FontFamily="Tahoma"; children carry their point sizes,
                                          converted to Avalonia DIP as (pt * 96 / 72):
                                          9.75pt -> 13, 12pt -> 16, 14.25pt -> 19, 18pt -> 24, 24pt -> 32.

    WIRING CONTRACT — the partner code-behind (FormQuickABView.axaml.cs) owns ALL behaviour:
      * This view is IMPERATIVE, not MVVM: intentionally NO x:DataType, NO DataContext, NO {Binding}.
        The x:Name'd controls below are the entire integration surface and keep their ORIGINAL
        WinForms names so the migrated code-behind addresses them exactly as FormQuickAB.cs did. No
        event handlers are wired in this markup — the code-behind attaches them by name (reproducing
        the WinForms handlers: btnzAPlus/btnzABLine/btnzABCurve_Click, btnRefSide*_Click,
        btnACurve/btnBCurve/btnPausePlayCurve_Click, btnALine/btnBLine/btnEnter_AB_Click,
        btnAPlus/nudHeading/btnEnter_APlus_Click, btnAddTime/btnAdd_Click, btnCancelCurve_Click,
        textBox_Click) — so the view compiles independently of whatever handler names it chooses.
      * The WinForms System.Windows.Forms.Timer "timer1" (Interval 500, drives live A+/B preview) is
        non-visual and is therefore NOT part of this markup; the code-behind reproduces it with an
        Avalonia DispatcherTimer.

    LAYOUT — five OVERLAPPING sub-panels, all positioned at (3,3) and 241 x 310 (FormQuickAB_Load sets
    every panel Top=3/Left=3 so they stack); the code-behind toggles IsVisible to step through the
    wizard. Initial visibility mirrors Load: panelChoose visible, the rest hidden. Each panel is a
    Canvas so its children keep the EXACT designer Location/Size (relative to the panel) for pixel
    parity — the same absolute-Canvas approach as the sibling GPS views (e.g. FormShiftPosView).

    Button glyphs are served from the GPS assembly ("AgOpenGPS") via avares:// URIs, the same
    btnImages/ convention the other GPS Avalonia views use. WinForms drew button.Image at NATIVE size,
    centred, so each glyph keeps its native pixel size (Cancel64/OK64/BoundaryRight/LetterABlue/
    LetterBBlue/boundaryPause/JobNameTime = 64 x 64; the ABTrack* track-type icons = 80 x 80).
    [XPLAT] note: the WinForms resource member Properties.Resources.ABTrackA_ maps to the asset FILE
    "ABTrackA+.png" (the resx sanitises '+' to '_' for the C# identifier); the avares URI uses the
    real file name (a '+' is a literal character in a URI path, preserved by the asset loader).

    No WinForms, no OpenTK, no GMap, no ColorPicker types are referenced.
-->
<Window xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
        xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        x:Class="AgOpenGPS.Views.FormQuickABView"
        Title="Tracks"
        Width="270"
        Height="360"
        Background="WhiteSmoke"
        SystemDecorations="Full"
        CanResize="False"
        ShowInTaskbar="False"
        WindowStartupLocation="Manual"
        FontFamily="Tahoma">

    <Window.Styles>
        <!--
            imageButton: reproduces the WinForms FlatStyle.Flat + FlatAppearance.BorderSize = 0 +
            BackColor = Transparent image buttons — just the centred glyph, with no button surface in
            any visual state. The :pointerover / :pressed template overrides suppress the Fluent
            hover/press fill that would otherwise box the glyph (same technique as the sibling views).
        -->
        <Style Selector="Button.imageButton">
            <Setter Property="Background" Value="Transparent" />
            <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="Transparent" />
            <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0" />
            <Setter Property="Padding" Value="0" />
            <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
            <Setter Property="VerticalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="Button.imageButton:pointerover /template/ ContentPresenter#PART_ContentPresenter">
            <Setter Property="Background" Value="Transparent" />
            <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="Transparent" />
            <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="Button.imageButton:pressed /template/ ContentPresenter#PART_ContentPresenter">
            <Setter Property="Background" Value="Transparent" />
            <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="Transparent" />
            <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0" />
        </Style>

        <!--
            chooseCard: the three large track-type "cards" on panelChoose. WinForms set
            BackColor = White + FlatAppearance.BorderColor = Black (default BorderSize 1) for these,
            so — unlike the flat/transparent action buttons — they render as a white tile with a thin
            black border holding the centred 80 x 80 track icon. Hover/pressed keep the white-tile face.
        -->
        <Style Selector="Button.chooseCard">
            <Setter Property="Background" Value="White" />
            <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="Black" />
            <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="1" />
            <Setter Property="Padding" Value="0" />
            <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
            <Setter Property="VerticalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="Button.chooseCard:pointerover /template/ ContentPresenter#PART_ContentPresenter">
            <Setter Property="Background" Value="White" />
            <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="Black" />
            <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="1" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="Button.chooseCard:pressed /template/ ContentPresenter#PART_ContentPresenter">
            <Setter Property="Background" Value="White" />
            <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="Black" />
            <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="1" />
        </Style>

        <!--
            numBox: nudHeading is the WinForms NudlessNumericUpDown (a numeric box whose only
            interaction is Click -> on-screen keypad). It is reproduced as a Button styled to look
            like that LightCyan numeric box (Tahoma 24pt Bold -> 32 DIP, centred, thin grey border).
            The code-behind opens FormNumeric on click and toggles IsEnabled. Hover/pressed keep the
            LightCyan face so it never reads as a normal raised button.
        -->
        <Style Selector="Button.numBox">
            <Setter Property="Background" Value="LightCyan" />
            <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="Gray" />
            <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="1" />
            <Setter Property="Padding" Value="0" />
            <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="Black" />
            <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
            <Setter Property="VerticalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="Button.numBox:pointerover /template/ ContentPresenter#PART_ContentPresenter">
            <Setter Property="Background" Value="LightCyan" />
            <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="Gray" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="Button.numBox:pressed /template/ ContentPresenter#PART_ContentPresenter">
            <Setter Property="Background" Value="LightCyan" />
            <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="Gray" />
        </Style>
    </Window.Styles>

    <!--
        Root host. The five sub-panels are siblings stacked at the same (3,3) origin; only one is
        visible at a time. Declared in the WinForms Controls.Add order (panelAPlus, panelABLine,
        panelChoose, panelCurve, panelName) so the z-order matches; visibility — not z-order — drives
        which step shows.
    -->
    <Canvas>

        <!-- ==================== panelChoose (Gainsboro) — initial step, VISIBLE ==================== -->
        <Canvas x:Name="panelChoose"
                Canvas.Left="3" Canvas.Top="3"
                Width="241" Height="310"
                Background="Gainsboro"
                IsVisible="True">

            <!-- btnzAPlus: choose "A+" track. Designer (9,29) 96x98, icon ABTrackA_ (file ABTrackA+.png, 80x80). -->
            <Button x:Name="btnzAPlus"
                    Classes="chooseCard"
                    Canvas.Left="9" Canvas.Top="29"
                    Width="96" Height="98"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="A Plus track">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/ABTrackA+.png"
                       Width="80" Height="80" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnzABLine: choose "AB line" track. Designer (138,29) 96x98, icon ABTrackAB (80x80). -->
            <Button x:Name="btnzABLine"
                    Classes="chooseCard"
                    Canvas.Left="138" Canvas.Top="29"
                    Width="96" Height="98"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="AB line track">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/ABTrackAB.png"
                       Width="80" Height="80" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnzABCurve: choose "Curve" track. Designer (138,195) 96x98, icon ABTrackCurve (80x80). -->
            <Button x:Name="btnzABCurve"
                    Classes="chooseCard"
                    Canvas.Left="138" Canvas.Top="195"
                    Width="96" Height="98"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Curve track">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/ABTrackCurve.png"
                       Width="80" Height="80" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnCancelChoose: cancel the wizard. Designer (12,223) 65x70, glyph Cancel64. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnCancelChoose"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="12" Canvas.Top="223"
                    Width="65" Height="70"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Cancel">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/Cancel64.png"
                       Width="64" Height="64" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>
        </Canvas>

        <!-- ==================== panelCurve (WhiteSmoke) — build a Curve track ==================== -->
        <Canvas x:Name="panelCurve"
                Canvas.Left="3" Canvas.Top="3"
                Width="241" Height="310"
                Background="WhiteSmoke"
                IsVisible="False">

            <!-- labelCurve: header. Designer (4,4), Tahoma 9.75pt -> 13 DIP. Code-behind localises to gStr.gsCurve. -->
            <TextBlock x:Name="labelCurve"
                       Canvas.Left="4" Canvas.Top="4"
                       FontSize="13"
                       Foreground="Black"
                       Text="Curve" />

            <!-- btnRefSideCurve: toggle reference side. Designer (88,2) 70x60, glyph BoundaryRight (swapped at runtime). -->
            <Button x:Name="btnRefSideCurve"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="88" Canvas.Top="2"
                    Width="70" Height="60"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Reference side">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/BoundaryRight.png"
                       Width="64" Height="64" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnACurve: set point A / add point. Designer (7,97) 88x70, glyph LetterABlue. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnACurve"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="7" Canvas.Top="97"
                    Width="88" Height="70"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="A point">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/LetterABlue.png"
                       Width="64" Height="64" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnPausePlay: pause/record the curve. Designer (144,97) 88x70, glyph boundaryPause (swapped at runtime). -->
            <Button x:Name="btnPausePlay"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="144" Canvas.Top="97"
                    Width="88" Height="70"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Pause or record">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/boundaryPause.png"
                       Width="64" Height="64" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnCancel_Curve: cancel. Designer (7,233) 88x70, glyph Cancel64. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnCancel_Curve"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="7" Canvas.Top="233"
                    Width="88" Height="70"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Cancel">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/Cancel64.png"
                       Width="64" Height="64" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnBCurve: set point B / accept. Designer (144,233) 88x70, glyph OK64. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnBCurve"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="144" Canvas.Top="233"
                    Width="88" Height="70"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="B point">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/OK64.png"
                       Width="64" Height="64" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- labelStatus: "Status:" caption. Designer (36,195), Tahoma 14.25pt Bold -> 19 DIP. Localised to gStr.gsStatus. -->
            <TextBlock x:Name="labelStatus"
                       Canvas.Left="36" Canvas.Top="195"
                       FontSize="19" FontWeight="Bold"
                       Foreground="Black"
                       Text="Status: " />

            <!-- lblCurveExists: live recording state. Designer (111,195), Tahoma 14.25pt Bold -> 19 DIP, centred. -->
            <TextBlock x:Name="lblCurveExists"
                       Canvas.Left="111" Canvas.Top="195"
                       FontSize="19" FontWeight="Bold"
                       Foreground="Black"
                       TextAlignment="Center"
                       Text="&gt; OFF &lt;" />
        </Canvas>

        <!-- ==================== panelABLine (Transparent) — build an AB line ==================== -->
        <Canvas x:Name="panelABLine"
                Canvas.Left="3" Canvas.Top="3"
                Width="241" Height="310"
                Background="Transparent"
                IsVisible="False">

            <!-- labelABLine: header. Designer (5,4), 13 DIP. Code-behind localises to gStr.gsABline. -->
            <TextBlock x:Name="labelABLine"
                       Canvas.Left="5" Canvas.Top="4"
                       FontSize="13"
                       Foreground="Black"
                       Text="AB Line" />

            <!-- btnRefSideAB: toggle reference side. Designer (90,3) 70x60, glyph BoundaryRight. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnRefSideAB"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="90" Canvas.Top="3"
                    Width="70" Height="60"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Reference side">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/BoundaryRight.png"
                       Width="64" Height="64" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnALine: set point A. Designer (13,103) 80x78, glyph LetterABlue. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnALine"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="13" Canvas.Top="103"
                    Width="80" Height="78"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="A point">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/LetterABlue.png"
                       Width="64" Height="64" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnBLine: set point B (code-behind tints it Teal once set). Designer (156,103) 80x78, glyph LetterBBlue. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnBLine"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="156" Canvas.Top="103"
                    Width="80" Height="78"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="B point">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/LetterBBlue.png"
                       Width="64" Height="64" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnCancel_ABLine: cancel. Designer (8,233) 88x70, glyph Cancel64. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnCancel_ABLine"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="8" Canvas.Top="233"
                    Width="88" Height="70"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Cancel">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/Cancel64.png"
                       Width="64" Height="64" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnEnter_AB: accept the AB line. Designer (142,233) 88x70, glyph OK64, ImageAlign MiddleRight. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnEnter_AB"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="142" Canvas.Top="233"
                    Width="88" Height="70"
                    HorizontalContentAlignment="Right"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Enter">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/OK64.png"
                       Width="64" Height="64" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>
        </Canvas>

        <!-- ==================== panelAPlus (Transparent) — build an A+ heading line ==================== -->
        <Canvas x:Name="panelAPlus"
                Canvas.Left="3" Canvas.Top="3"
                Width="241" Height="310"
                Background="Transparent"
                IsVisible="False">

            <!-- labelAPlus: header. Designer (6,4), 13 DIP. Code-behind localises to gStr.gsAPlus. -->
            <TextBlock x:Name="labelAPlus"
                       Canvas.Left="6" Canvas.Top="4"
                       FontSize="13"
                       Foreground="Black"
                       Text="A+" />

            <!-- btnRefSideAPlus: toggle reference side. Designer (26,62) 70x60, glyph BoundaryRight. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnRefSideAPlus"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="26" Canvas.Top="62"
                    Width="70" Height="60"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Reference side">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/BoundaryRight.png"
                       Width="64" Height="64" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnAPlus: set point A. Designer (140,53) 80x78, glyph LetterABlue. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnAPlus"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="140" Canvas.Top="53"
                    Width="80" Height="78"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="A point">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/LetterABlue.png"
                       Width="64" Height="64" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- nudHeading: heading entry box (NudlessNumericUpDown -> Button styled as a numeric box).
                 Designer (25,174) 195x46, LightCyan, Tahoma 24pt Bold -> 32 DIP, centred, value "0". -->
            <Button x:Name="nudHeading"
                    Classes="numBox"
                    Canvas.Left="25" Canvas.Top="174"
                    Width="195" Height="46"
                    FontSize="32" FontWeight="Bold"
                    Content="0"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Heading degrees" />

            <!-- btnCancel_APlus: cancel. Designer (8,238) 88x70, glyph Cancel64. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnCancel_APlus"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="8" Canvas.Top="238"
                    Width="88" Height="70"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Cancel">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/Cancel64.png"
                       Width="64" Height="64" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnEnter_APlus: accept the A+ line. Designer (142,238) 88x70, glyph OK64, ImageAlign MiddleRight. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnEnter_APlus"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="142" Canvas.Top="238"
                    Width="88" Height="70"
                    HorizontalContentAlignment="Right"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Enter">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/OK64.png"
                       Width="64" Height="64" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>
        </Canvas>

        <!-- ==================== panelName (WhiteSmoke) — name the new track ==================== -->
        <Canvas x:Name="panelName"
                Canvas.Left="3" Canvas.Top="3"
                Width="241" Height="310"
                Background="WhiteSmoke"
                IsVisible="False">

            <!-- labelAddName: "Add Name" prompt (literal, NOT translated in the source). Designer (16,14),
                 Tahoma 9.75pt -> 13 DIP. -->
            <TextBlock x:Name="labelAddName"
                       Canvas.Left="16" Canvas.Top="14"
                       FontSize="13"
                       Foreground="Black"
                       Text="Add Name" />

            <!-- textBox1: editable multiline name field. Designer (17,37) 204x77, LightCyan, BorderStyle
                 FixedSingle (BorderThickness 1, square corners), Tahoma 14.25pt -> 19 DIP, centred, MaxLength 100,
                 Multiline (AcceptsReturn + wrap). The code-behind shows the on-screen keyboard on click. -->
            <TextBox x:Name="textBox1"
                     Canvas.Left="17" Canvas.Top="37"
                     Width="204" Height="77"
                     Background="LightCyan"
                     BorderBrush="Gray"
                     BorderThickness="1"
                     CornerRadius="0"
                     FontSize="19"
                     MaxLength="100"
                     AcceptsReturn="True"
                     TextWrapping="Wrap"
                     TextAlignment="Center"
                     VerticalContentAlignment="Top" />

            <!-- label1: "+" join glyph between the name and the timestamp button. Designer (48,154),
                 Tahoma 18pt Bold -> 24 DIP. -->
            <TextBlock x:Name="label1"
                       Canvas.Left="48" Canvas.Top="154"
                       FontSize="24" FontWeight="Bold"
                       Foreground="Black"
                       Text="+" />

            <!-- btnAddTime: append the current time to the name. Designer (87,133) 68x69, glyph JobNameTime. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnAddTime"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="87" Canvas.Top="133"
                    Width="68" Height="69"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Add time">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/JobNameTime.png"
                       Width="64" Height="64" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>

            <!-- btnAdd: confirm the name and save the track. Designer (141,233) 88x70, glyph OK64. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnAdd"
                    Classes="imageButton"
                    Canvas.Left="141" Canvas.Top="233"
                    Width="88" Height="70"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Add">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/OK64.png"
                       Width="64" Height="64" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>
        </Canvas>

    </Canvas>
</Window>
